  "goodToKnow": "Die Artillerie is artillery, the heavy guns of an army. In the First World War, artillery caused most casualties on the Western Front. Since 2022, artillery ammunition (Artilleriemunition) for Ukraine has become a major topic, and German firm Rheinmetall has expanded production. Das Geschütz is a gun or cannon; schweres Geschütz auffahren means to bring out the big guns in an argument. Stressed on the last syllable. It has no plural."
